{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21750","headline":"乐府古题序 梦上天 · 元稹","name":"乐府古题序 梦上天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦上高高天，高高苍苍高不极。\n下视五岳块累累，仰天依旧苍苍色。\n蹋云耸身身更上，攀天上天攀未得。\n西瞻若水兔轮低，东望蟠桃海波黑。\n日月之光不到此，非暗非明烟塞塞。\n天悠地远身跨风，下无阶梯上无力。\n来时畏有他人上，截断龙胡斩鹏翼。\n茫茫漫漫方自悲，哭向青云椎素臆。\n哭声厌咽旁人恶，唤起惊悲泪飘露。\n千慙万谢唤厌人，向使无君终不寤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}